        "definition": "to match or echo in vowel sounds, especially in verse",
        "definitionCN": "在元音上相配或呼应，尤见于诗句",
        "example": "The syllables assonate on a long o.",
        "exampleCN": "这些音节以长 o 音相互谐应。",
        "why": "The verb keeps assonare's sense: vowels sounding toward each other.",
        "whyCN": "动词保留了 assonare 之义：元音彼此靠拢发声。"
      },
      {
        "no": "02",
        "title": "To echo in sound generally",
        "titleCN": "音似地呼应",
        "definition": "to respond or answer in similar sound",
        "definitionCN": "以相似之音作答或呼应",
        "example": "Bells assonate across the valley.",
        "exampleCN": "钟声在山谷间交相呼应。",
        "why": "Sounding toward becomes answering sound with sound.",
        "whyCN": "「向对方发声」引申为以声应声。"
      }
    ],
